    "updated_at": "2016-05-17T05:27:51Z",
    "body": "No, it cannot. That page is still broken with the spec change, see https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/907#issuecomment-204375907 above.\n\n```\n<menuitem><span>foo</span><menu>bar</menu></menuitem>\n```\n\n->\n- `menuitem`\n  - `span`\n    - \"foo\"\n- `menu`\n  - \"bar\"\n",
